Liferay-Releng-App-Description: A Digital Sales Room (DSR) is a private, centralized, and secure microsite for B2B sellers and buyers to collaborate throughout the sales process. A DSR is designed to meet the needs of the modern, self-directed buyer by consolidating all sales-related content, communication, and key stakeholders into a single hub. Liferay DSR replaces fragmented email chains and disorganized files with a single source of truth, providing a streamlined and personalized buying experience that reduces friction and moves deals forward.
Liferay-Releng-App-Title: ${liferay.releng.app.title.prefix} Digital Sales Room
